  "Get Reduced CSDK 13 (<link></link>) and extract the whole ZIP to a short folder outside OneDrive, for example <code>{folder}</code>.": "获取 Reduced CSDK 13（<link></link>），并将整个 ZIP 压缩包解压到 OneDrive 之外、路径较短的文件夹，例如 <code>{folder}</code>。",
  "Click <strong>Find Reduced CSDK 13</strong> below, or choose that folder as Community SDK in Settings. Then click the suggested path under Resource compiler, or Fix the marked path, so the compiler follows.": "点击下方的<strong>查找 Reduced CSDK 13</strong>，或在设置中将该文件夹选为社区 SDK。然后点击“资源编译器”下方建议的路径，或修复标记的路径，让编译器随之更新。",
  "Your setup compiles hero models with a downloaded model toolset. Once Reduced CSDK 13 is the Community SDK, click <strong>Compile models with Reduced CSDK 13</strong> under Model compiler in Settings.": "你的配置使用下载的模型工具集编译英雄模型。将 Reduced CSDK 13 设为社区 SDK 后，请在设置中“模型编译器”下方点击<strong>使用 Reduced CSDK 13 编译模型</strong>。",
  "Save settings, run Test my setup, then Analyze and build your project again.": "保存设置，运行“测试我的设置”，然后重新分析并构建你的项目。",
  "Your projects, prepared models and settings are kept; materials are compiled again on the next build. Once a build works, you can delete the Reduced CSDK 12 folder (the working folders the app made inside it go with it) and, when models compile with Reduced CSDK 13, the downloaded model toolset.": "你的项目、准备好的模型和设置都会保留；下次构建时会重新编译材质。构建成功后，你可以删除 Reduced CSDK 12 文件夹（程序在其中创建的工作文件夹会一并删除）；当模型改用 Reduced CSDK 13 编译后，也可以删除下载的模型工具集。",
  "Looking…": "正在查找…",
  "Find Reduced CSDK 13": "查找 Reduced CSDK 13",
  "Keep Reduced CSDK 12 and do not show this again": "继续使用 Reduced CSDK 12，不再显示此提示",
  "Ignore": "忽略",
  "Ignore keeps Reduced CSDK 12 and does not show this again. Settings can show it again.": "“忽略”会继续使用 Reduced CSDK 12，并不再显示此提示。可以在设置中重新显示。",
